Output laravel-10-to-13.gif

Require bash
Require composer
Require php
Require sha256sum

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 24
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set WindowBar ColorfulRight
Set BorderRadius 12
Set Framerate 20
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.25
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type "cd /app && clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "bash examples/five-minute-demo/run-demo.sh"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 22s
